  "releaseNotes": "## v2.6.4 (patch)\n\nChanges since v2.6.3:\n\n- Parse with the provider's decimal separator and signs [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Reject a precision below one in ReduceSignificance [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Report zero as not normal, and nothing as subnormal [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
